19 0 obj
<< /A 275 0 R /Alt (Flowchart illustrating the selection process of lung cancer cases and controls. From the OSU EMR data warehouse \(2013-2020\), 5,034 lung cancer cases and 545,880 controls were identified. Of these, 4,975 cases were lung carcinoma, excluding 59 for other histologies. For controls, 27,291 matched controls were randomly selected, excluding 24,373 for onset over forty-nine years. Finally, 256 lung carcinoma cases and 2,921 matched controls were under fifty years of age.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 14 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
20 0 obj
<< /A 276 0 R /Alt (Bar graph showing odds ratios for vaping combined with smoking\nand smoking only, across different groups: PAC under fifty, women under fifty, men\nunder fifty, age under fifty, and all ages. Vaping and smoking have higher odds ratios\ncompared to smoking only in all categories.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 16 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
